job('RG-C811A','RG-C811A','Panasonic_WhisperChoice_RG_C811A_R2025','Panasonic','ceiling',[15.5,13,8.375],['White','Steel','Black'],'panasonic','https://ftp.panasonic.com/ventilationfan/installation/rg-c811a_rg-c811ha_eng.pdf','Manufacturer manual page 4: 13-inch grille, 10.25-inch housing plan, 7.5-inch housing height, 3.875-inch adapter extension and 0.875-inch grille projection. Component checks distinguish these from the derived combined envelope. ASSUMPTION: hole pitch, bezel section, internal impeller and junction box detail; perforations are real native holes. Adjustable joist bracket, wiring and duct connector engineering are excluded. Mechanical Equipment face-based visualization family.'),
job('KZC1285334','VL20338-BK','Kuzco_Vera_38_Black_R2025','Kuzco Lighting','wall',[37.87,4.75,3.25],['Black','Opal'],'vera','https://kuzcolighting.com/products/vera-vl20338-kuzco','Exact 38-inch version, 37.87 x 4.75 x 3.25 inches, replaces the incorrect 22.87-inch linked default. Backplate 4.75 square x 0.5. Curved front and rear housing with separate upper/lower recessed diffusers. Cross-section detail inferred from product photography and prior native Vera profile.'),
job('HIN1284470','28914BK-LL','Hinkley_Tetra_28914BK_LL_R2025','Hinkley','wall',[5,12,5.75],['Black','Clear','Opal'],'tetra','https://www.hinkley.com/28914bk-ll.html','5 x 12 x 5.75 inches, 4.75 x 5.125 backplate. Two open ends with recessed lens/optic assemblies. ASSUMPTION: wall thickness, recess and individual optical components from photographs; no photometric source.'),
job('MXG1933070','MXG1933070','Huxe_Silvio_5_Black_R2025','Huxe','ceiling',[5,5,.75],['Black','Opal'],'silvio','https://nola.gov/getattachment/NEXT/City-Planning/Meetings/Previous-Years-Meetings/Previous-Years/2024-Year/January/Design-Advisory-Committee/1-17-2024-10-00-00-AM/Item-3_.pdf/','Exact Lumens-authored MXG1933070 cut sheet reproduced in the public project packet: black, 5-inch diameter, 0.75-inch height. Current Lumens URL returned HTTP 403. ASSUMPTION: rim thickness and optic recess; no dimensions borrowed from larger variants.'),
job('PBL1129156','SKY FSH 18 DOM BLK-3000K','Pablo_Sky_Dome_18_Wall_Black_Aluminum_R2025','Pablo','wall',[18,18,4],['Black','Aluminum','Opal'],'sky_flush','https://pablodesigns.com/product/sky-flush','18-inch shade diameter and 4-inch projection; 6.5-inch rear mount. Wall host follows the scheduled wall-sconce use. Matte-black reflector with polished-aluminum lamp rim and opal diffuser. ASSUMPTION: shallow reflector curve and central optic dimensions; manufacturer offers STEP geometry rather than a direct RFA in inspected resources.'),
job('PBL1034468','SKY DOM 18 BLK-3000K','Pablo_Sky_Dome_18_Pendant_Black_Aluminum_R2025','Pablo','ceiling',[18,18,48],['Black','Aluminum','Opal'],'sky_pendant','https://pablodesigns.com/product/sky-dome','18-inch diameter, 17.5-inch fixture body, 5.3 x 1.25-inch canopy. ASSUMPTION: 48-inch installed drop; reflector position and lens diameters from photography. Body height is checked independently of assumed suspension.'),
job('KZC1403797','WS97204-BK/CL','Kuzco_Stephord_WS97204_BK_CL_R2025','Kuzco Lighting','wall',[4.75,4.75,1.63],['Black','Clear','Opal'],'stephord','https://kuzcolighting.com/products/stephord-ws97204-kuzco','4.75-inch diameter, 1.63-inch projection. Separate clear curved glass lens, black central disk and concealed opal ring. ASSUMPTION: internal lens curvature and thickness from photograph. Downloaded 2019 manufacturer RFA measured 4.7244 x 4.7244 x 1.5748 inches; preserved as source, not accepted as a current inch-spec match.','Public manufacturer ZIP downloaded, CRC checked and opened in Revit 2025. Current nominal projection differs by 1.402 mm; native reconstruction follows published current dimensions.'),
job('KZC1193209','WS52505-BK/CL','Kuzco_Cedar_WS52505_BK_CL_R2025','Kuzco Lighting','wall',[5,5.75,5],['Black','Clear','Opal'],'cedar','https://kuzcolighting.com/products/cedar-ws52505-kuzco','Shade body 4 x 5.75 x 5 inches; round 5-inch backplate makes the full installed width 5 inches. Do not confuse body width with aggregate mount width. ASSUMPTION: glass thickness, rear stem and domed internal diffuser profile.'),
