job('KZC780336','VL17024-CH','Kuzco_Rona_VL17024_Chrome_R2025','Kuzco Lighting','wall',[4.5,24,2.75],['Chrome','Opal'],'rona','https://kuzcolighting.com/products/rona-vl17024-kuzco','Current 24-inch Rona, 4.5-inch square backplate x 0.625, 2.75-inch extension. Vertical default; may be rotated on wall. ASSUMPTION: 1.25-inch optic diameter and clamp contours from photograph. Manufacturer 2019 RFA contains model metadata VL10724, an interior-light-source warning and incomplete Fine-detail native geometry; retained as reference.','Manufacturer RFA publicly downloaded and opened in 2025; inconsistent metadata, missing nested solid evidence and a rendering warning prevented accepting it unchanged.'),
job('KZC862138','WS25118-BK-UNV','Kuzco_Pandora_WS25118_BK_UNV_R2025','Kuzco Lighting','wall',[4.62,21,3.87],['Black','Opal'],'pandora','https://kuzcolighting.com/products/pandora-ws25118-kuzco','Exact universal-voltage variant overall 4.62 x 21 x 3.87 inches. Offset vertical blade and curved backplate follow photograph. ASSUMPTION: mounting-body height, rounded face depth and hidden rear optic width; no electrical connector design.'),
job('KZC610420','EW22109-BK','Kuzco_Vista_EW22109_Black_R2025','Kuzco Lighting','wall',[4.25,8.625,3.5],['Black','Opal'],'vista','https://kuzcolighting.com/products/vista-ew22109-kuzco','4.25 x 8.625 x 3.5 inches. Open-ended rectangular body on taller plate, two recessed light slots. ASSUMPTION: extrusion wall thickness and internal optical tray geometry from manufacturer/product photographs.'),
