job('700TRSPPYL1RNB-LED930','700TRSPPYL1RNB-LED930','Visual_Comfort_Pylon_Natural_Brass_R2025','Visual Comfort Modern','ceiling',[4.6,4.6,48],['Brass','Clear','Black','Opal'],'pylon','https://www.visualcomfort.com/us/p/pylon-1-light-pendant-700trsppyl1','Natural-brass and clear 1.2-inch diameter x 18.6-inch body, 4.6 x 0.8-inch canopy. ASSUMPTION: 48-inch installed drop, fine ribs and optical end details. Current primary resource list contains SketchUp and photometrics, without a native Revit link.'),
job('SID660347','15823 2020U+R03L01 1000MU','Lodes_A_Tube_Nano_Black_White_Canopy_R2025','Lodes','ceiling',[4.92,4.92,48],['Black','White','Clear','Opal'],'a_tube','https://www.lodes.com/en/products/a-tube-nano/','Exact black 23.62-inch x 0.78-inch body with white 4.92-inch canopy. ASSUMPTION: 48-inch installed drop, 0.75-inch canopy thickness, and internal optic details. Thin clear bottom optic retained.'),
